{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-26T11:22:42.361Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"bde5973a64851be416b1c911","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.332","source":"probe"}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-gh1787"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"GH-1787: extension workspace discovery ignores GIT_CEILING_DIRECTORIES and binds a non-Git tracker to its parent checkout"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Published 2026.11.24 and 2026.11.25 supply the enclosing Git checkout as an extension command's workspace even when the explicitly selected child workspace is not in a repository by Git's own discovery. With a Git repository at parent/, a non-Git workspace at parent/child/, GIT_CEILING_DIRECTORIES set to parent/ and PM_SOURCE_WORKSPACE_ROOT set to child/, git rev-parse --show-toplevel refuses to discover a repository, yet a local extension command sees source_workspace_root = parent, repo_root = parent and pm_root_rel = child/.agents/pm, with or without Git on the command PATH. Expected: source_workspace_root = child, no repo_root, and pm_root_rel = .agents/pm. The pm-swarm capacity and continuation tests select Git versus tracker-only behavior from this context, and four tracker-only cases fail under an ordinary nested Git parent."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["extensions","gh:1787","git","workspace"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-11-26T11:22:42.361Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-26T11:22:42.361Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:claude-code"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":240},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"A nested non-Git tracker fixture under a real parent checkout, with the explicit source root and ceiling, gives the child root, no VCS root and the correct tracker-relative path, with and without Git on the command PATH; Ordinary Git checkouts and .git-file worktrees keep their discovery, and linked-test runs keep their independent tracker path; The linked pm-swarm tracker-only cases pass against the corrected host"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-doxj"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":80},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"An extension handler for a nested non-Git tracker under a ceiling sees the child source root, no VCS root, and the tracker path relative to the child"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"The handler sees the parent checkout as source and repo root and a tracker path relative to the parent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-fc9gm4","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-11-26T11:22:42.361Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-j4ac9a","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-11-26T11:22:42.361Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"3ccc2e9218990c697b2bdfb52ac40796023aa218e393a0a17b8d5f24adcbf757","item_hash_version":3,"message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"f180db3b97c120d2b927cbbf8bca984acd2f234c9fbf0c4d9e22e95a6fc9f610"}
